% Scenario: a dashed curve's outline. The dash pattern and phase are
% applied along the flattened curve, each dash ending in a round cap
% (PLRM3 §8.2 setdash, strokepath): page 1 fills the outline, page 2
% strokes the same curve.
/path { 100 150 moveto 100 500 500 500 500 150 curveto } def
16 setlinewidth 1 setlinecap [40 20] 10 setdash
path strokepath fill
showpage
16 setlinewidth 1 setlinecap [40 20] 10 setdash
path stroke
showpage
